WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:10,280
extend, circle and count, then listen and point.

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:17,500
colourful chameleons

3
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,540
look! chameleons!

4
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:25,200
the plant is yellow.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:29,300
the chameleon is yellow too.

6
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,900
the ground is grey.

7
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,900
the chameleon is grey too.

8
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:42,620
the tree is red.

9
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:46,690
the chameleon is red too.

10
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:51,350
the branch is green.

11
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:55,350
the chameleon is green too.

12
00:00:55,350 --> 00:01:06,550
think! what colours are the chameleons and the plants?
